ass=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1co93ja\" data-styles-preset=\"ExfCXuxmW\" style=\"--framer-text-alignment:center;--framer-text-color:var(--token-995dab92-f1f1-4af5-aa21-62de23edf583, rgb(4, 47, 64))\">Prebuilt ERP Integration with Our Platform</h2></div><div class=\"framer-lae7t7\"><div class=\"framer-1394yfx\" data-border=\"true\"><!--$--><div class=\"framer-90kx71\"><div class=\"framer-11fnbsw\"><svg class=\"framer-69oYV framer-1kshjp8\" role=\"presentation\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#1430708703\"></use></svg><div class=\"framer-1qlgfcb\"><div class=\"framer-1wpt3l7\" data-framer-name=\"Title\" style=\"outline:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;flex-shrink:0;transform:none\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\"><h4 class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-euz4yx\" data-styles-preset=\"pvpXp2D5p\" style=\"--framer-text-color:var(--token-995dab92-f1f1-4af5-aa21-62de23edf583, rgb(4, 47, 64))\">Integration with leading ERPs</h4></div><div class=\"framer-g5c33r\" data-framer-name=\"Title\" style=\"outline:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;flex-shrink:0;transform:none\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1xlbyg5\">Hyperbots delivers pre-built ERP integration connectors for NetSuite, SAP S/4HANA, Sage 300, Sage Intacct, Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Centeral, Deltek Costpoint, Epicor and QuickBooks. Ready for fast code free deployment.</p></div></div></div></div><!--/$--></div><div class=\"framer-11xttbo\" data-border=\"true\"><!--$--><div class=\"framer-19dhx3i\"><div class=\"framer-dzk2w8\"><svg class=\"framer-VME8T framer-1tp22va\" role=\"presentation\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#1312851439\"></use></svg><div class=\"framer-2dk7ra\"><div class=\"framer-q5aqb6\" data-framer-name=\"Title\" style=\"outline:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;flex-shrink:0;transform:none\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\"><h4 class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-euz4yx\" data-styles-preset=\"pvpXp2D5p\" style=\"--framer-text-color:var(--token-995dab92-f1f1-4af5-aa21-62de23edf583, rgb(4, 47, 64))\">Exhaustive integration</h4></div><div class=\"framer-xf8llx\" data-framer-name=\"Title\" style=\"outline:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;flex-shrink:0;transform:none\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1xlbyg5\">The Hyperbots Co-Pilots deliver exhaustive ERP integration\u2014providing full read-and-write access to expenses, Chart of Accounts (COA), vendor and item masters, assets, and liabilities to power end-to-end AI-driven automation</p></div></div></div></div><!--/$--></div><div class=\"framer-i6vo51\" data-border=\"true\"><!--$--><div class=\"framer-1ltwrn\"><div class=\"framer-smrnlm\"><svg class=\"framer-cDUB7 framer-10c4xis\" role=\"presentation\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#78418125\"></use></svg><div class=\"framer-14u6x76\"><div class=\"framer-1gxadi5\" data-framer-name=\"Title\" style=\"outline:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;flex-shrink:0;transform:none\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\"><h4 class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-euz4yx\" data-styles-preset=\"pvpXp2D5p\" style=\"--framer-text-color:var(--token-995dab92-f1f1-4af5-aa21-62de23edf583, rgb(4, 47, 64))\">Real-time read-write sync</h4></div><div class=\"framer-1oyb2k3\" data-framer-name=\"Title\" style=\"outline:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;flex-shrink:0;transform:none\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1xlbyg5\">Hyperbots Co-Pilots deliver real-time, bidirectional ERP data integration\u2014instantly syncing expenses, vendors, items, and COA details to keep every finance workflow seamless, accurate, and audit-ready</p></div></div></div></div><!--/$--></div><div class=\"framer-1dvnrwd\" data-border=\"true\"><!--$--><div class=\"framer-jgb3ad\"><div class=\"framer-zzrymo\"><svg class=\"framer-5lBxb framer-67bl05\" role=\"presentation\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#2921829994\"></use></svg><div class=\"framer-z2h9wi\"><div class=\"framer-1rl1wmy\" data-framer-name=\"Title\" style=\"outline:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;flex-shrink:0;transform:none\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\"><h4 class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-euz4yx\" data-styles-preset=\"pvpXp2D5p\" style=\"--framer-text-color:var(--token-995dab92-f1f1-4af5-aa21-62de23edf583, rgb(4, 47, 64))\">On-premise &amp; cloud ERP integration</h4></div><div class=\"framer-197bk3e\" data-framer-name=\"Title\" style=\"outline:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;flex-shrink:0;transform:none\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1xlbyg5\">Hyperbots Co-Pilots natively integrate with both on-premise ERP and cloud ERP platforms, enabling secure, high-speed data exchange and consistent finance automation across any deployment model</p></div></div></div></div><!--/$--></div><div class=\"framer-1ltn5ds\" data-border=\"true\"><!--$--><div class=\"framer-58o1j9\"><div class=\"framer-jj144a\"><svg class=\"framer-gJjMN framer-26aior\" role=\"presentation\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#1438844295\"></use></svg><div class=\"framer-1hbskbp\"><div class=\"framer-1qnxgqx\" data-framer-name=\"Title\" style=\"outline:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;flex-shrink:0;transform:none\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\"><h4 class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-euz4yx\" data-styles-preset=\"pvpXp2D5p\" style=\"--framer-text-color:var(--token-995dab92-f1f1-4af5-aa21-62de23edf583, rgb(4, 47, 64))\">Exception and error-handling</h4></div><div class=\"framer-t515o3